# Veycraft — Goose Hints

Read `AGENTS.md` and `skills/REGISTRY.md` at session start. Follow progressive disclosure: open only the specific `skills/*.md` file whose trigger matches the current step.

Key workflows:
- Setup & readiness gate: `skills/00-interrogate-and-onboard.md`, `skills/01-resume-ingestion.md`
- Daily run & triage: `skills/00-daily-run.md`, `skills/02-discover-and-triage.md`
- Tailor & verify: `skills/03-tailor-resume-and-verify.md`
- Form fill & `APPROVE` gate: `skills/04-fill-and-apply.md`
- Dossier, outreach, logging & insights: `skills/05-outreach-and-interview-prep.md`, `skills/06-log-and-insights.md`

Use Playwright MCP (`./browser-profile`) with `browser_snapshot` roles/refs only. Never guess legal answers, fabricate metrics, or bypass CAPTCHA/2FA.
